graph TD
  U[用户提出工作流需求] --> H[Builder Handler<br/>authApp + teamId + tmbId + isRoot]

  subgraph SERVICE[FastGPT Service 权限边界]
    REPO[(SystemToolRepo<br/>Plugin Service / Mongo Config)] --> C[System Tool Capability Service<br/>按来源、状态、团队、hideTags 过滤]
    H --> C
    C --> B[请求级脱敏工具包<br/>严格 Schema + id/source 唯一身份]
  end

  subgraph BUILDER[Workflow Builder 服务端]
    H --> AL[现有 AgentLoop<br/>workflow_cli_query / stage / commit]
    B --> SP[服务端组合 Provider<br/>builtin + authorized systemTool]
    AL --> CLI[现有 CLI 命令与 Workflow Core]
    CLI --> V[服务端 plan 重算与提交校验]
    SP --> V
  end

  subgraph SANDBOX[Sandbox CLI 进程]
    B --> FILE[事务受保护 JSON 文件]
    FILE --> LOADER[CLI Loader<br/>校验工具包并构造组合 Provider]
    LOADER --> CLI
  end

  V --> DOC[目标 WorkflowDocument]
  DOC --> UI[原子应用到当前画布]
  DOC -. 后续真实运行 .-> RT[现有 runTool / SystemToolRepo Runtime<br/>重新检查状态并解析 Secret]

  classDef auth fill:#fff4d6,stroke:#9a6700,color:#3b2f00;
  classDef data fill:#e8f1ff,stroke:#2457a7,color:#102a43;
  classDef unchanged fill:#e9f7ef,stroke:#287d4b,color:#143d28;
  class C,B,FILE auth;
  class SP,LOADER,CLI,V,DOC data;
  class AL,UI,RT unchanged;
